query pools: smaller occlusion reservations on KosmicKrisp (NutsEmu)

KosmicKrisp's visibility table has 32768 slots, reserved at query-pool creation.
The default 4096-query batch allows only eight pools, including mostly unused
slots held by command allocators. GTA V Enhanced repeatedly exhausts the table
when its world loads. Use 256-query batches on this driver; command allocators
already use the actual query_count and obtain another pool when one fills.
Keep the default on other drivers, log the selected batch once, and include
query type/count in failures so the next phone profile identifies the allocation.

